[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_j1t8c")
icon = ExtResource("1_ir1w2")
label = "Chunk Manager"
tooltip = "Manages the creation, deletion and changing of individual chunk settings. Chunk dimensions and cell related settings can be changed in the [u][EDITOR_ACCENT]Terrain Settings[/EDITOR_ACCENT][/u] tool.

[b]Info:[/b]
Chunk cell merge modes can be used to alter the merge thresholds of neighbouring vertices. These have the biggest impact on the overall [i]feel[/i] of the terrain.

[ul][EDITOR_ACCENT]Cubic[/EDITOR_ACCENT]: The most blocky of all the modes. Has minimal smoothing between cells;[/ul]

[ul][EDITOR_ACCENT]Polyhedron[/EDITOR_ACCENT]: Blocky terrain with slight cell smoothing;[/ul]

[ul][EDITOR_ACCENT]Rounded Polyhedron[/EDITOR_ACCENT]: A 50/50 mix between having smooth and blocky terrain;[/ul]

[ul][EDITOR_ACCENT]Semi Round[/EDITOR_ACCENT]: Mostly smooth terrain with occasional blocky cells;[/ul]

[ul][EDITOR_ACCENT]Spherical[/EDITOR_ACCENT]: All the terrain will become smooth. This mode looks the most unnatural for the marching squares algorithm.[/ul]

[b]Shortcuts:[/b]
[ul]CTRL+LMB: Change the currently selected chunk to the hovered chunk.[/ul]"
attributes = SubResource("Resource_w6p77")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://brkjbcthwswel"
